# CR 704.3: state-based actions are checked only when a player would receive
# priority, never mid-resolution. human, at 2 life, casts Lightning Helix on
# themself: the 3 damage drops them to -1, but the same resolution's "you gain
# 3 life" brings them back to 2 before any check runs, so they never lose.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 W
queue targets human
queue action human cast 1
passpriority
